我现在喜欢聊天了
I like talking now.

366
00:17:42,730 --> 00:17:43,410
我想我会告诉他
I think I'm gonna tell him

367
00:17:43,410 --> 00:17:45,110
我第一次离家出走的事
about the first time I ran away from home.

368
00:17:45,470 --> 00:17:46,570
我爬到了底特律
I crawled to Detroit.

369
00:17:47,690 --> 00:17:49,450
麦克斯 我觉得这样很棒
Max, I think it's great you were able

370
00:17:49,450 --> 00:17:51,050
你能忽视欧文的症状
to look past Owen's situation.

371
00:17:51,470 --> 00:17:53,710
即使只看其中一根 也会觉得很恶心吧
Even the sight of one of them can be disturbing.

372
00:17:55,530 --> 00:17:56,490
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

373
00:17:57,030 --> 00:17:58,270
好消息
Oh, good news.

374
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,410
奥列格的精子龙精虎猛
Oleg's got strong sperm.

375
00:18:01,770 --> 00:18:04,170
这块饼干我也吃不下了
Well, that's the end of this cookie.

376
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:06,630
坏消息是...
And the bad news is...

377
00:18:06,630 --> 00:18:08,530
我以为刚才那就是坏消息
Oh, I thought that was the bad news.

378
00:18:09,230 --> 00:18:11,650
我回去看医生 他说
I went back to the doctor, and he said

379
00:18:12,010 --> 00:18:13,390
我还能怀孕
I can still get pregnant.

380
00:18:13,810 --> 00:18:15,790
只是会比较耗时费工
It's just gonna take a while, you know,

381
00:18:16,010 --> 00:18:19,270
因为我的蛋[卵子]有点像这餐厅的蛋
'cause my eggs are a bit like the eggs here at the diner.

382
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:21,710
虽然严格来说没有坏
You know, not exactly bad,

383
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:24,910
但也将近过期了
just real close to the use-by date.

384
00:18:26,270 --> 00:18:27,670
苏菲 什么让你改变心意回去看医生
Sophie, what made you go back to the doctor?

385
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:31,290
我经常进行深刻的自我反省
Well, you know, I was doing a lot of soul-searching,

386
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:33,530
还有我的钱包落在那里了
and I left my purse there.

387
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:36,410
于是我就想 既然我都在这了
So I figured, you know, while I'm here,

388
00:18:36,430 --> 00:18:38,310
何不做个检查
why not take a look, you know?

389
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,290
就像麦克斯所说
I mean, like Max said,

390
00:18:39,710 --> 00:18:41,130
每个人都会有些问题
everybody's got something.

391
00:18:41,950 --> 00:18:42,810
不是我瞎吹
Well, not to brag,

392
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,310
但我那位有两个"问题"
but mine's got two somethings.

393
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:48,250
你好 我来找...
Hi. I'm here for, uh...

394
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:50,450
"两"人桌 我是说一人
Table for two. I mean one!

395
00:18:52,730 --> 00:18:53,950
我为什么要用"两"呢
Why did I say two?

396
00:18:55,170 --> 00:18:57,030
我不知道 祝你今天愉快
I don't know. Have a good one.

397
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:58,510
你俩也是 我是说你也是
You too. I mean, one!

398
00:19:00,830 --> 00:19:03,670
你好呀
Oh, hi. Yeah.

399
00:19:03,730 --> 00:19:06,250
我听说了很多你的事
I've heard a lot about you.

400
00:19:06,450 --> 00:19:07,910
但也不是一切啦
You know, but not everything.

401
00:19:08,170 --> 00:19:10,210
就"两"件事而已
You know, just a couple of things.

402
00:19:12,270 --> 00:19:13,850
-她知道了吗 -什么
- She knows? - What?

403
00:19:14,010 --> 00:19:14,630
不
Um, no.

404
00:19:15,650 --> 00:19:17,070
这就像跟偶像猫王见面
This is like meeting Elvis

405
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:19,830
前提是他有两根鸡鸡 还没死在马桶上
if Elvis had two penises and didn't die on his toilet.

406
00:19:21,050 --> 00:19:22,370
好吧 他们都知道了
Okay. They all know.

407
00:19:23,430 --> 00:19:25,130
欧文 等等 对不起嘛
Owen, wait! Wait. I'm sorry.

408
00:19:27,410 --> 00:19:30,290
我以为他走路姿态会不一样呢
Uh, I expected him to walk differently.

409
00:19:30,610 --> 00:19:31,850
其他人也这么认为吗
Did anybody else think that?

410
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:35,570
是啊 我在想他是不是三角裤和四角裤一起穿
Yeah, I was wondering if he wears briefs and boxers.

411
00:19:36,230 --> 00:19:39,210
他会不会让我跟他的"无间双龙"自拍呢
I was wondering if he'd let me take a selfie with them.

412
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:41,390
各位 麦克斯真的很喜欢欧文
Guys, Max really likes Owen,

413
00:19:41,390 --> 00:19:42,830
现在这感情可能得告"吹"了
and she might have blown it.

414
00:19:42,830 --> 00:19:44,570
不得不说 "吹"起来是双倍的活儿啊
Which, again, seems like a lot of work.

415
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,590
怎么样了
What happened?

416
00:19:48,190 --> 00:19:49,650
他跟我分手了
He broke up with me.

417
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:51,170
他居然跟你分手
He broke up with you?

418
00:19:51,610 --> 00:19:53,050
他说我背叛了他的信任
He said I betrayed his trust,

419
00:19:53,050 --> 00:19:54,630
我说 不管我想不想
and I said, whether I like it or not,

420
00:19:54,630 --> 00:19:55,790
你们都知道了
you guys know everything.

421
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:56,850
你们是我沉重的负担
You're part of the package.

422
00:19:57,490 --> 00:19:58,590
那他怎么说
And what did he say?

423
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:01,350
他说我的负担对他来说太重了
He said my package was too much for him.

424
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:04,210
他好意思说你负担太重[鸡鸡太多]
Your package is too much?

425
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:07,750
他自己可是"双龙"出海
I mean, he's driving a double-decker.

426
00:20:10,770 --> 00:20:11,750
卷心菜沙拉桶 自己来
Coleslaw tub. Come alone.

427
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:15,310
你没事吧
Are you okay?

428
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:16,390
没事
I'm fine.

429
00:20:16,390 --> 00:20:18,430
我不是很信你
I don't really believe you,

430
00:20:18,430 --> 00:20:20,730
但我知道有东西能让你好过点
but I do know something that might make you feel better.

431
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,770
天啊 不要吧
Oh, God! No!

432
00:20:22,850 --> 00:20:24,010
闺蜜谈心靠边闪
No more girl talk.

433
00:20:24,892 --> 00:20:26,990
私人珍藏
Private stash.

434
00:20:26,990 --> 00:20:28,550
我在这里经常觉得难过
I get sad a lot in here.

435
00:20:30,730 --> 00:20:32,670
我真的很喜欢他
I really liked him.

436
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:35,950
我按你说的做了
I did what you said,

437
00:20:35,950 --> 00:20:37,570
我让他了解我的内心
and I let him get to know me.

438
00:20:39,350 --> 00:20:40,830
我再也不会这样做了
I'm never doing that again.

439
00:20:42,250 --> 00:20:43,650
这样感觉不够力啊
This isn't doing it for me.

440
00:20:46,810 --> 00:20:48,690
我会想死他的
I'm gonna miss him.
